OL,3,ASailors missing after fresh attacks on
OL,4,ABlack Sea vessels, Bulgaria says
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne merchant ship has sunk and its crew
OL,7,Fis missing after a drone attack in the
OL,8,FBlack Sea, Bulgarian officials say.
OL,10,FA second vessel - carrying grain - was
OL,11,Falso hit within Bulgaria's exclusive
OL,12,Feconomic zone, Prime Minister Rumen
OL,13,FRadev said. Its crew of 18 were
OL,14,Frescued.
OL,16,FRadev did not say who was behind the
OL,17,Fattacks, which come as Russia
OL,18,Fintensifies strikes in the Black Sea as
OL,19,Fpart of its war against Ukraine.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
